# SS-17 - Investigate licensed vendors and global data APIs
Workstream ID: SS-17
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/17
Status: NOT_STARTED
Milestone: M4
Dependencies: SS-03

## Purpose
Assess independent feeds when free/broker data cannot meet study quality or coverage needs.

## Tasks
- [ ] TrueData: personal API quote, exchange authorization, history/actions and retention.
- [ ] Global Datafeeds: REST/socket history, NSE/BSE coverage, contract and continuity.
- [ ] Accelpix: independent authorization check, API history, revisions and personal license.
- [ ] Twelve Data: NSE/BSE Grow+ EOD, credit limits and adjustment terms, not assumed free Basic.
- [ ] Alpha Vantage: actual Indian symbols/history, free quotas and educational access eligibility.
- [ ] EODHD: entitled exchange/ticker discovery, NSE/BSE depth, delistings and actions.
- [ ] Enterprise options: exchange-direct, LSEG, Bloomberg and FactSet discovery/cost boundary.
- [ ] Produce common qualification receipts per viable option without purchases.

## Acceptance criteria
- Marketing claims do not establish contracts, data accuracy or redistribution rights.
- Global coverage is not assumed to imply usable NSE/BSE data on a free plan.

## Completion evidence
- Primary pages read for six named retail/vendor candidates; no subscription or sample entitlement.
- Enterprise discovery remains unverified.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Registered independent-vendor and cross-market provider investigations.
